   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "09ed1faa-f038-8aeb-9737-f67d5cc69b66",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75-2\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"f69dbdc2-e2a8-46e8-0363-f3786af2a5e6\">Designed for retail</strong> – Stylish packaging and shelf-ready formats<br data-w-id=\"51968ef3-f8e5-7082-c064-91fed6fdf863\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"a57daff5-6ac4-281f-7733-9cbe0d0b2736\">Small-batch &amp; premium</strong> – Direct from Japan, always fresh<br data-w-id=\"d49a272a-a3dd-3b0e-2c08-f7c403215fe1\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"fff24900-1abb-aff6-6c81-fc5e38416556\">Private label options</strong> – Create your own branded matcha line<br data-w-id=\"c4ecfcdd-3097-51e3-1eeb-421a5626af99\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"20647216-8112-5fab-4ba4-edbdf7addce2\">Supportive partnership</strong> – Low minimums and marketing-ready content</div>",
    "text": "✔️ Designed for retail – Stylish packaging and shelf-ready formats\n✔️ Small-batch & premium – Direct from Japan, always fresh\n✔️ Private label options – Create your own branded matcha line\n✔️ Supportive partnership – Low minimums and marketing-ready content"
   },
   "attributes": {}
